          "annotations": [],
          "text": "{\"stories\":[{\"id\":\"s000029\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":7,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":8,\"storytelling\":7,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"The cart’s transformation naturally redirects the parade into a reading gathering, ending with a vivid circle of listening feet; a few transitions remain somewhat ornamental.\"},{\"id\":\"s000057\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":6,\"style\":6,\"grammar\":8,\"storytelling\":5,\"overall\":6},\"note\":\"The promised book route is completed, but the folding-room reveal has little effect on the resolution and the final image says the books are still snug inside after the route.\"},{\"id\":\"s000047\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":6,\"style\":7,\"grammar\":8,\"storytelling\":6,\"overall\":6},\"note\":\"Mallow clearly turns an empty cart into a silly float, with a strong crown-shadow ending, but the book premise is abandoned and the shelf reveal does not affect the outcome.\"},{\"id\":\"s000073\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":7,\"style\":6,\"grammar\":8,\"storytelling\":6,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"A clear conflict between parade ambitions and a promise to children resolves in favor of the book route; the quiet bell gives the ending a concrete, if subdued, image.\"},{\"id\":\"s000034\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":5,\"style\":6,\"grammar\":8,\"storytelling\":5,\"overall\":6},\"note\":\"The float plot has a colorful finish, but the folding shelves are revealed after the banner is mounted and do not meaningfully change Mallow’s completed float action.\"},{\"id\":\"s000043\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":7,\"style\":6,\"grammar\":8,\"storytelling\":6,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"The cart is redirected from Mallow’s parade idea to the waiting children, creating a coherent small resolution, though the secret shelves do not drive the final action.\"},{\"id\":\"s000068\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":7,\"style\":6,\"grammar\":8,\"storytelling\":6,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"The explicit promise to children makes the choice of the neighborhood stop feel consequential, and the bookmobile with its quiet bell provides a complete closing image.\"},{\"id\":\"s000096\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":7,\"style\":6,\"grammar\":8,\"storytelling\":6,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"This follows a clear route from parade distraction to book delivery, but the magical shelf detail is decorative rather than necessary to the resolution.\"},{\"id\":\"s000005\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":7,\"style\":6,\"grammar\":8,\"storytelling\":6,\"overall\":7},\"note\":\"The cart is treated as a promise and reaches the waiting children, giving the story a solid resolution; the tiny-room reveal remains disconnected from what happens next.\"},{\"id\":\"s000085\",\"rating\":{\"coherence\":6,\"style\":6,\"grammar\":8,\"storytelling\":6,\"overall\":6},\"note\":\"Specific book titles add child-friendly texture and the route reaches its audience, but Nia first lifts books out and then loads the already-loaded cart, muddying the action.\"}],\"diversity\":{\"premise\":3,\"causal_path\":3,\"ending\":4,\"language\":4,\"overall\":3},\"diversity_evidence\":\"Most samples repeat the same central conflict: Mayor Mallow imagines a parade while Nia and Tuck redirect a book cart to children, ending at the neighborhood stop (s000057, s000073, s000043, s000068, s000096, s000005, s000085). Only s000029 materially changes the outcome into a stationary/traveling reading gathering, while s000047 and s000034 instead carry out Mallow’s float plan. Wording and scene order vary more than causal structure; this small sample does not establish diversity for the entire generator.\",\"plot_groups\":[{\"story_ids\":[\"s000057\",\"s000073\",\"s000043\",\"s000068\",\"s000096\",\"s000005\",\"s000085\"],\"summary\":\"Parade ambitions conflict with books promised to children; the cart is taken to the neighborhood stop and becomes a bookmobile invitation.\"},{\"story_ids\":[\"s000047\",\"s000034\"],\"summary\":\"Mallow finds an empty cart, turns it into a bannered parade float, and completes a triumphant loop.\"},{\"story_ids\":[\"s000029\"],\"summary\":\"The cart’s hidden shelves transform it into a reading room, causing the parade to pause for a shared story.\"}]}",
          "type": "output_text",
          "logprobs": []
        }
